msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_000:1"
msgid "Please note that upon completing the quest “Positively Mandervillous,” you will receive a Manderville weapon for <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 『素晴らしきマンダヴィルウェポン』を、<br>「<if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>」で受けますか？
#. de: Möchtest du den Auftrag mit deinem aktuellen Job <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color> annehmen?
#. fr: Commencer la quête en restant <if $gn4><sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if><nbsp>?
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_001:1"
msgid "Please ensure you have changed to your desired job before speaking with the House Manderville artisan."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>のマンダヴィルウェポンを作成しますか？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Finaliser l'arme des Manderville pour <if $gn4><sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if><nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_Q1_000_001:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: もう少し考える
#. de: Ich möchte den Job wechseln.
#. fr: Prendre le temps de réfléchir
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "Undertake this quest as another job."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>のマンダヴィルウェポンを作成する
#. de: Ich möchte den Auftrag als <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color> weiterspielen.
#. fr: Finaliser l'arme des Manderville pour <if $gn4><sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if>
#. speaker: A1
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row), column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 14 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 26 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 33 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_A1_000_003:1"
msgid "Undertake this quest as <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 作成したいマンダヴィルウェポンに応じたジョブとなり、<br>再度、マンダヴィル家の職人に声をかけてください。
#. de: Wähle den Job, für den du deine Manderville-Waffe verbessern möchtest, und sprich dann erneut mit dem Handwerker der Mandervilles, um den Auftrag anzunehmen.
#. fr: Sélectionnez le job de votre choix puis reparlez à l'artisan des Manderville.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_005:1"
msgid "Please speak with the House Manderville artisan again when you are ready to undertake this quest."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」および、<br>「<sheet Item $n2 0>」はすでに取得済みです。<br>ほかのジョブとなり、再度話しかけてください。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> und <noun-de Item 2 $n2 1 4 1> bereits erlangt. Wechsle zu einem anderen Job und sprich erneut mit dem Handwerker der Mandervilles.
#. fr: Vous possédez déjà <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1> et <noun-fr Item 2 $n2 1 1>. Sélectionnez un autre job et reparlez à l'artisan des Manderville.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_006:1"
msgid "You have already received <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> and <noun-en Item 2 $n2 1 1>. Please change to a different job and speak with the House Manderville artisan again."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」は、<br>すでに取得済みです。<br>ほかのジョブとなり、再度話しかけてください。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> bereits erlangt. Wechsle zu einem anderen Job und sprich erneut mit dem Handwerker der Mandervilles.
#. fr: Vous possédez déjà <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1>. Sélectionnez un autre job et reparlez à l'artisan des Manderville.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_007:1"
msgid "You have already received <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>. Please change to a different job and speak with the House Manderville artisan again."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」および、<br>「<sheet Item $n2 0>」を所持、<br>または装備していないと……
#. de: Du musst sowohl <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> als auch <noun-de Item 2 $n2 1 4 1> bei dir haben.
#. fr: Vous devez être en possession <noun-fr Item 9 $n1 1 1> et <noun-fr Item 9 $n2 1 1>...
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_008:1"
msgid "Please ensure that <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> and <noun-en Item 2 $n2 1 1> are either equipped, in your Armoury Chest, or in your inventory."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 『素晴らしきマンダヴィルウェポン』を受注できません。
#. de: Nur so kannst du den Auftrag annehmen.
#. fr: ... pour pouvoir accepter cette quête.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_100_008:1"
msgid "Upon doing so, you will become eligible to accept the quest “Positively Mandervillous.”"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を所持、<br>または装備していないと、<br>『素晴らしきマンダヴィルウェポン』を受注できません。
#. de: Du musst <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> bei dir haben, um den Auftrag annehmen zu können.
#. fr: Vous devez être en possession <noun-fr Item 9 $n1 1 1> pour pouvoir accepter cette quête.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_009:1"
msgid "In order to accept the quest “Positively Mandervillous,” please ensure that <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> is either equipped, in your Armoury Chest, or in your inventory."
msgstr ""

#. ja: マンダヴィルウェポンの最終改良ですね？<br>お任せください、こちらの準備は万端ですよ！<br>残念ながら「<sheet Item 41032 0>」以外は、ですが……。
#. de: Seid gegrüßt, <if $gn4>Frau<else>Herr</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Ihr wünscht sicherlich, einer Eurer Manderville-Waffen den letzten Schliff zu verleihen, habe ich Recht? Sehr gerne! Ihr müsstet mir nur das notwendige Material besorgen.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Dame<else>Messire</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, quel plaisir de vous revoir<nbsp>! Nous sommes toujours prêts à finaliser d'autres armes des Manderville, à condition que vous apportiez <noun-fr Item 2 41032 2 1> requis...
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_010:1"
msgid "Might I assume you're here to perfect another weapon? Everything is in readiness...except for the incredibly rare and difficult to acquire meteoritic material, of course."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 相変わらずで申し訳ないのですが、<br>「<sheet Item 41032 0>」だけは調達していただきたい。<br>3個あれば十分ですので、どうかお願いします！
#. de: Und zwar bräuchte ich drei <noun-de Item 5 41032 2 4 1>. Wenn Ihr mir die besorgen könntet, kann ich mich sofort an die Arbeit machen!
#. fr: Si cela ne tenait qu'à moi, je vous fournirais les matériaux nécessaires... Mais madame Julyan veille au grain, et nous devons nous serrer la ceinture<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_011:1"
msgid "If you would be so kind as to provide three ample samples of crystallite, then we can proceed with the augmentation of your chosen armament."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 41032 0>」は、<br>エーテライト・プラザにいる「ジュブルンナ」から、<br>交換できます。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 41032 2 1 1></capitalize> können bei Jubrunnah am Ätherytenplatz in Radz-at-Han erworben werden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez obtenir <noun-fr Item 1 41032 2 1> auprès de Jubrunnah sur la place de l'Éthérite.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_012:1"
msgid "Chunks of cosmic crystallite can be obtained from Jubrunnah at the aetheryte plaza in Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 41032 0>」は調達できましたでしょうか？<br>最終改良に向けて、こちらはいつでもお待ちしております！
#. de: Lasst Euch gerne Zeit mit der Beschaffung des Materials. Ich bin den ganzen Tag hier und warte auf Eure Rückkehr!
#. fr: Prenez votre temps pour rassembler les matériaux. Nos fourneaux ne s'éteignent jamais, et ce malgré les mesures de sobriété prises par madame Julyan<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_020:1"
msgid "Manage to obtain that crystallite yet? Not to rush you, of course─simply occupying this crafting station gives me a sense of fulfillment like no other, so please, take all the time you need!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 41032 0>」は、<br>エーテライト・プラザにいる「ジュブルンナ」から、<br>交換できます。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 41032 2 1 1></capitalize> können bei Jubrunnah am Ätherytenplatz in Radz-at-Han erworben werden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez obtenir <noun-fr Item 1 41032 2 1> auprès de Jubrunnah sur la place de l'Éthérite.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_021:1"
msgid "Chunks of cosmic crystallite can be obtained from Jubrunnah at the aetheryte plaza in Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 素材を調達していただけたのですね！<br>それでは、最終改良を施したいと思うので、<br>「マンダヴィルウェポン」を装備から外してもらえませんか？
#. de: Ah, da seid Ihr ja wieder! Und Ihr habt das benötigte Material mitgebracht, wie erfreulich! Dürfte ich Euch jetzt noch darum bitten, Eure Waffe abzulegen und sie mir zu überreichen?
#. fr: Je vois que vous avez réuni les matériaux nécessaires<nbsp>! À présent, veuillez enlever votre arme et me la confier, s'il vous plaît.
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_030:1"
msgid "I see you've brought the samples─the subtle glow of crystallite is unmistakable! And is that the weaponry you wish us to enhance...? Ahem. The process will be far less uncomfortable for all involved if you were to remove it first."
msgstr ""

#. ja: お待ちしておりました！<br>調達していただいた「<sheet Item 41032 0>」をお渡しください。
#. de: Donnerwetter, <noun-de Item 6 41032 2 1 1>!<br>Oh, bitte verzeiht meine unprofessionelle Überschwänglichkeit, aber eine solch herausragende Qualität sieht man nicht alle Tage<nbsp>...
#. fr: Ces morceaux de cristallite cosmique sont absolument parfaits<nbsp>! Je suis sûr que vous serez <if $gn4>satisfaite<else>satisfait</if> du résultat.
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_031:1"
msgid "Are we all set to proceed, <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ありがとうございます。<br>さっそく製薬堂のみなさんに協力してもらい、必要な成分を抽出し、<br>ゲロルトさんの力を借りて、最終改良に取り掛かりましょう！
#. de: Ich werde Meister Gerolt Bescheid geben, damit wir uns sofort an die Arbeit machen können. Eure Waffe wird in Kürze einen mandervillösen Feinschliff erhalten!
#. fr: Merci beaucoup. Je vais prévenir maître Gerolt pour que nous nous mettions au travail im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment. Votre arme sera bientôt manderveilleusement finalisée<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_040:1"
msgid "Splendid, splendid. I shall gather our High Crucible dance troupe to extract the essence, then have Master Gerolt elevate your weaponry to the pinnacle of smithing perfection!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: これより、マンダヴィリアン油の塗布を行います。<br>油の調合によって、武器の能力を調整するので、<br>使い手であるあなたの好みをお伝えください。
#. de: Kommen wir nun zu der Beschichtung mit unserem exklusiven Ultramanderville-Öl.
#. fr: Le moment est venu d'enduire votre arme avec l'huile d'Ultimanderville. Vos in<shy>struc<shy>tions seront de la première importance pour obtenir la composition exacte qui saura répondre à vos besoins.
#. speaker: MANDERVILALCHEMIST
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_MANDERVILALCHEMIST_000_041:1"
msgid "Now for the coating of Ultramanderville."
msgstr ""

#. ja: どのような能力をご希望するか、<br>よく考えて決めることをお勧めいたします……。
#. de: Die Zusammensetzung des Öls erfolgt auf der Grundlage der von dir angegebenen Präferenzen. Dazu musst du mich nur wissen lassen, welche Eigenschaften dir besonders wichtig sind.
#. fr: Prenez le temps nécessaire pour réfléchir aux propriétés que vous souhaiteriez conférer à votre arme, je suis à votre disposition.
#. speaker: MANDERVILALCHEMIST
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_MANDERVILALCHEMIST_000_042:1"
msgid "As before, we shall finalize the oil's composition based upon your stated preferences. The weight given to each martial quality is entirely yours to decide..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q2
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_Q2_000_000:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「マンダヴィルウェポン」の能力を調整する
#. de: Die Eigenschaften deiner Manderville-Waffe anpassen.
#. fr: Ajuster les attributs de l'arme
#. speaker: A2
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_A2_000_001:1"
msgid "Adjust the attributes of your Manderville weaponry."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 説明を聞く
#. de: Mehr über diesen Arbeitsschritt erfahren.
#. fr: En savoir plus sur cette opération
#. speaker: A2
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_A2_000_002:1"
msgid "Learn about Manderville weaponry attributes."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Nichts.
#. fr: Annuler
#. speaker: A2
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_A2_000_003:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 最終改良したマンダヴィルウェポンに、<br>3種類のパラメータを選択して付与できます。<br>その内のひとつは付与できる数値が低くなります。
#. de: Du kannst drei Parameter auswählen, die du deiner neu verbesserten Manderville-Waffe hinzufügen möchtest. Einer dieser Parameter wird auf einen niedrigeren Wert als die beiden anderen gesetzt.
#. fr: Le revêtement à l'huile d'Ultimanderville permet de sélectionner manuellement trois attributs différents pour votre arme des Manderville. L'un des trois sera toujours inférieur aux deux autres.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_043:1"
msgid "You can choose three attributes to add to your newly augmented Manderville weaponry. One of these attributes will be set to a lower value than the other two."
msgstr ""

#. ja: パラメータの選択が完了したら、<br>「付与実行」を選択することで、<br>割り振ったパラメータに合わせて、付与が行われます。
#. de: Wähle „Bestätigen“, wenn du die Parameterwerte entsprechend angepasst hast und mit dem Verbesserungsprozess fortfahren möchtest.
#. fr: Une fois les valeurs con<shy>ve<shy>na<shy>ble<shy>ment sé<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>nées, choisissez “Valider” pour lancer le processus de finalisation.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_044:1"
msgid "Once you have adjusted the values to your liking, select “Confirm” to finalize your decision."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 再調整を行う場合も、<br>「<sheet Item 41032 0>」が必要となりますので、<br>よく考えながら、パラメータを調整していきましょう。
#. de: Um die Parameter deiner Waffe erneut umzustellen, brauchst du wiederum einen kosmischen Kristallit. Wäge deine Auswahl daher sorgfältig ab, bevor du sie bestätigst.
#. fr: Chaque réajustement des attributs requiert <noun-fr Item 1 41032 1 1>. Prenez le temps de bien réfléchir avant de confirmer vos choix.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_SYSTEM_000_045:1"
msgid "Resetting your weaponry's attributes will require an additional chunk of cosmic crystallite, so consider your choices carefully."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 承知いたしました！<br>それでは仕上げを行います……！
#. de: Sehr wohl! Bitte gedulde dich einen Moment, es sollte nicht allzu lange dauern.
#. fr: Bien compris<nbsp>! Veuillez patienter quelques minutes...
#. speaker: MANDERVILALCHEMIST
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_MANDERVILALCHEMIST_000_046:1"
msgid "As you wish, <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: よし、完成したぞ！<br>ソイツがマンダヴィルウェポンの最後の段階……
#. de: Ha, seht euch das an! Der Zenit der Handwerkskunst ist erreicht!
#. fr: Ha ha, zieute-moi donc un peu ça<nbsp>! Une arme des Manderville au summum de sa puissance...
#. speaker: GEROLT
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_GEROLT_000_047:1"
msgid "And done. Bloody immaculate craftsmanship, if I do say so meself..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」、<br>そして、「<sheet Item $n2 0>」だ！
#. de: Bitte sehr, <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 1 1> und <noun-de Item 1 $n2 1 1 1>, nur für dich!
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> et son <noun-fr Item 12 $n2 1 1><nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_GEROLT_000_048:1"
msgid "Bear yer new <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> an' <noun-en Item 3 $n2 1 1> with pride!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」だ！
#. de: Bitte sehr, <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 1 1>, nur für dich!
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize><nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_GEROLT_000_049:1"
msgid "Bear yer new <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> with pride!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: またひとつ、マンダヴィルウェポンが完成しました！<br>惚れ惚れするような出来栄えですよ！
#. de: Eine Manderville-Waffe in ihrer mächtigsten und schönsten Form! Was für eine un<shy>ver<shy>gleich<shy>li<shy>che Meisterleistung!
#. fr: Voilà une nouvelle arme des Manderville élevée à la quintessence de sa forme et de sa fonction. Une <i>manderveille</i> de plus à notre actif<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_050:1"
msgid "Another masterpiece of Manderville weaponry taken to its highest, finest form. The sense of achievement is incomparable!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: まあ、ほとんどオレ様の力だが、<br>お前らもさすがに少しは腕が上がってきたようだな……。
#. de: Was eben zu erwarten ist, wenn man einen wahrhaftigen Meister ans Werk lässt. Na gut, ich gebe zu, dass du dich langsam machst.
#. fr: Ouais, enfin bon, c'est bibi qui s'tape le gros du boulot, hein... Quoique, j'dois avouer que vous avez fait de gros progrès, tous les deux.
#. speaker: GEROLT
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_GEROLT_000_051:1"
msgid "Aye, especially since the achievement was mostly mine. Well...I s'pose you two have shown <i>some</i> improvement."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ほ、本当ですか？<br>ゲロルトさんに認められるなんて、身に余る光栄です！
#. de: W-Wirklich?! Was für eine Ehre, ein solches Lob aus Eurem Mund zu hören, Meister Gerolt!
#. fr: V-vous le pensez vraiment<nbsp>!? Maître Gerolt, vos compliments nous vont droit au cœur<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_052:1"
msgid "Y-You think so, Master Gerolt? O joyous day!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: お、おい、いまその舞を踊る必要はねぇだろ？
#. de: Halt lieber die Beine still, sonst nehm ich es zurück! 
#. fr: Hé<nbsp>! Vous croyez vraiment que c'est le moment<nbsp>!?
#. speaker: GEROLT
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_GEROLT_000_053:1"
msgid "Bloody hells, do ye have to do that now?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「紳士の舞」はたしかに<sheet Item 41032 0>から、<br>成分を抽出するため考案されたものですが……<br>マンダヴィル家では代々、喜びを表現する際に踊られてきたのです！
#. de: Ursprünglich wurde dieser Tanz entwickelt, um aus <noun-de Item 2 41032 2 3 1> die wertvolle Essenz zu extrahieren, doch inzwischen dient er auch noch einem anderen edlen Zweck: dem unverhohlenen Ausdruck reiner Freude!
#. fr: Sachez que si la danse du gentilhomme permet d'extraire l'essence d'un morceau de cristallite, elle sert avant tout à exprimer sa joie chez les Manderville, et ce depuis des générations<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_054:1"
msgid "While originally conceived to extract crystallite's aetherial energies, the Manderville dance has since come to serve another noble purpose: the unabashed expression of pure elation!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ゲロルトさんもご一緒にどうでしょう！？
#. de: Los, Meister Gerolt! Mach mit!
#. fr: Joignez-vous à nous, Maître Gerolt<nbsp>!
#. speaker: MANDERVILALCHEMIST
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_MANDERVILALCHEMIST_000_055:1"
msgid "Join us, Master Gerolt! You know you want to!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 調子に乗んな！<br>オメェらの仲間入りなんざ、まっぴらゴメンだぜ……！
#. de: Eher hacke ich mir mit einer rostigen Waffe die Hand ab!
#. fr: Et puis quoi encore<nbsp>!? Je suis ici pour cravacher, moi<nbsp>! Pas pour m'trémousser et prendre des poses ridicules<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_GEROLT_000_056:1"
msgid "Balls to that! Ye can bugger off with yer fancy fop-fashioned fellowship, an' all!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: またひとつ、マンダヴィルウェポンが完成しましたね！<br>これまた、素晴らしい出来栄えです！
#. de: Eine weitere mandervillöse Meisterkreation! Was für ein Prachtstück!
#. fr: Magnifique<nbsp>! Une arme manderveilleuse à ajouter à notre liste<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_060:1"
msgid "Simply marvelous! Another triumph of Mandervillian proportions!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 異星人の技術だろうが何だろうが、<br>オレ様の手にかかりゃ、すべて一級品よ！
#. de: Ob mit einfachsten Werkzeugen oder außerætherischem Schnickschnack: Wenn ich Hand anlege, wird jede Waffe zu einem Meisterwerk! 
#. fr: Et comment<nbsp>! Technologie extra-terrestre ou j'sais pas quoi, donnez-moi n'importe quel machin et j'en ferai un chef-d'œuvre<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_GEROLT_000_061:1"
msgid "Aye, be it ancient arms or alien technology, I'll make 'em all into masterpieces!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: さて、別種のマンダヴィルウェポンの最終改良が必要でしたら、<br>また私にお声がけください。
#. de: Lasst uns wissen, wenn Ihr noch mehr Waffen veredeln lassen möchtet, <if $gn4>Frau<else>Herr</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Dame<else>Messire</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, si vous avez d'autres armes des Manderville à finaliser, nous nous tenons à votre disposition.
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_070:1"
msgid "Wield your charges well, <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, and do let us know if you've more pieces in your armory you wish to perfect."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 41032 0>」さえ調達してくだされば、<br>私たちで最終改良いたしますので、お待ちしておりますよ。
#. de: Meister Gerolt und ich stehen Euch stets zu Diensten! Ah, aber denkt bitte daran, die notwendigen Materialien mitzubringen!
#. fr: Tant que vous nous fournirez des <noun-fr Item 12 41032 2 1>, nous répondrons à vos moindres désirs.
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_CRAFTER04653_000_071:1"
msgid "We shall be waiting with open arms...to accept the necessary offering of crystallite, ahaha."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 武器の能力を再調整したいという場合は、<br>こちらも「<sheet Item 41032 0>」をご用意のうえで、<br>私にお声がけくだされば、いつでも対応させていただきます。
#. de: Und wenn die Eigenschaften deiner Waffe neu angepasst werden sollen, kannst du mich jederzeit ansprechen. Es ist immer wieder eine Freude, Geschäfte mit dir zu machen! 
#. fr: Comme celui de réajuster les paramètres d'une arme déjà finalisée, par exemple<nbsp>! Nous vous attendrons ici, alors n'hésitez pas à faire appel à nos services.
#. speaker: MANDERVILALCHEMIST
msgctxt "quest/048/ChrHdy451_04807:TEXT_CHRHDY451_04807_MANDERVILALCHEMIST_000_072:1"
msgid "Likewise, I shall gladly adjust your weaponry's properties should you find their aetherial balance lacking. We are your humble servants!"
msgstr ""
